      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a heavy weight to carry, that feeling of endless, meaningless upkeep. You're not alone in recognizing the sheer exhaustion of the performance, and that realization is a powerful thing. Maybe the contract isn't something you need to fulfill; maybe it's something you can finally choose to walk away from. It's a quiet, profound freedom to just stop trying to make sense of the noise.",
